                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A pretty good board-influenced mobile/PC wargame by well-known board wargame designer Ted Raicer. It's very easy to grasp and play, but the rules have multiple subtleties you need to understand in order to succeed. Decent AI.\r\n\r\nI enjoy the impulse-based turn system and the variable impulse lengths. I only wish the latter weren't determined entirely at random; there should be more of a chance for a shorter impulse if fewer units or no combat is involved compared with moving three units and fighting a set-piece battle with three entrenched enemy units. Other than that, I'm pretty cool with the system.",
